edge_cases:
- id: EC_S0_INTERACT_SPAM
  condition: player spams medicine interaction during resolver
  expected: only one S0_MED option resolves; duplicate dose blocked
- id: EC_S0_WAIT_NO_IDLE_TIMEOUT
  condition: player does nothing during S0_CONDITION_GAMEPLAY
  expected: no route auto-selects
- id: EC_S0_FANNY_PATH_BLOCKED
  condition: player obstructs Fanny path
  expected: alternate authored anchor after TUNING timeout; no visible teleport
- id: EC_S0_WRITE_TOO_EARLY
  condition: player interacts with desk before Fanny intent resolution
  expected: inspect-only; no write lock
- id: EC_S0_MISSING_MOTIF
  condition: required motif absent due implementation bug
  expected: commit denied and debug reason surfaced
- id: EC_S0_RELOAD_POST_FANNY
  condition: load CP_S0_POST_FANNY
  expected: no duplicate medication, no duplicate Fanny writes, no duplicate motifs
- id: EC_S0_SKIP_CINEMATIC
  condition: player skips a skippable medication or write cinematic
  expected: all canonical state events still resolve
- id: EC_S0_EMERGENCY
  condition: MedicationSystem enters emergency
  expected: canonical rescue/fatal evaluation only
- id: EC_S0_AUTHOR_PACKET_ORDER
  condition: write lock occurs with active Sedation or StimulantActivation
  expected: AuthorPacket reads active values before lifecycle clear
- id: EC_S0_RELOAD_ROUTE_LOCKED_SELF_MED
  condition: StevensonFatal after choosing ANALGESIC or STIMULANT but before successful medication resolution
  expected: reload CP_S0_MED_ROUTE_LOCKED; same route remains selected; failed medication effects are absent; player may retry
    medication input
- id: EC_S0_RELOAD_ROUTE_LOCKED_WAIT
  condition: a future/master-driven external condition causes StevensonFatal after WAIT_FANNY route commit
  expected: reload CP_S0_MED_ROUTE_LOCKED; WAIT_FANNY remains selected; route writes remain exactly once; Fanny medication
    request may be selected again because it occurs downstream of this checkpoint
- id: EC_S0_ROUTE_RESELECTION_AFTER_FAIL
  condition: player fails after S0_MED route commit and reloads
  expected: route selection UI does not reopen; the committed route is restored from checkpoint
- id: EC_S0_FANNY_MEDICATION_CHOICE_SPAM
  condition: player submits more than one WAIT_FANNY medication-request option during dialogue
  expected: accept exactly one request, store one SelectedFannyMedicationID, and administer one dose only
- id: EC_S0_FANNY_EXACT_DOSE
  condition: Fanny administers either ANALGESIC_A or STIMULANT_S in S0
  expected: MedicationSystem receives the exact current canonical target and resolves CORRECT; no player dose input is used
- id: EC_S0_FANNY_MED_RELATIONSHIP_WRITE_DUPLICATION
  condition: WAIT_FANNY medication-request dialogue is replayed/reloaded after the request has committed
  expected: The selected LAUDANUM +3 / COCAINE -1 / FANNY_CHOOSE +4 FannyBond write applies exactly once.
- id: EC_S0_FANNY_RELATIONSHIP_CHOICE_DUPLICATION
  condition: TRUTH / MINIMIZE / ASK_HELP dialogue is replayed/reloaded after the choice has committed
  expected: The selected relationship-choice write applies exactly once and FannyPostDialogueMode is restored rather than
    re-fired.
- id: EC_S0_MINIMIZE_FANNY_EXIT
  condition: Player selects S0_MINIMIZE
  expected: FannyBond -4 and Agitation +2 is applied, Fanny leaves to sleep, and Stevenson can immediately proceed toward writing.
- id: EC_S0_HELP_FANNY_STAYS
  condition: Player selects S0_HELP
  expected: FannyBond +5 is applied, Fanny stays for a moment, and her presence never blocks the writing transition.
acceptance_tests:
- id: AT_S0_001
  test: Level starts from CP_S0_START with master Stevenson initial state and acute effects reset.
- id: AT_S0_002
